Practical No. 1 :-
Create a simple Knowledge Base using facts, predicates, clauses, and goals (Student-Course Database)

Prolog code:-

symptom(ravi, fever).
symptom(ravi, cough).
symptom(ravi, fatigue).
symptom(amit, sneezing).
symptom(amit, itchy_eyes).
symptom(sita, fever).
symptom(sita, cough).
symptom(sita, breathing_difficulty).

disease(Person, flu) :-
    symptom(Person, fever),
    symptom(Person, cough),
    symptom(Person, fatigue).
disease(Person, common_cold) :-
    symptom(Person, cough),
    symptom(Person, sneezing),
    symptom(Person, sore_throat).
disease(Person, allergy) :-
    symptom(Person, sneezing),
    symptom(Person, itchy_eyes).

disease(Person, possible_pneumonia) :-
    symptom(Person, fever),
    symptom(Person, cough),
    symptom(Person, breathing_difficulty).



Output Query:-
1.) disease(ravi, Disease).
2.) disease(amit, Disease).

Output:-
1.) Disease = flu
2.) Disease = allergy
